  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *tapado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to cover\" or \"to put a lid/cap on\" — *tapa la olla* (put the lid on the pot), *tápate con la manta* (cover yourself with the blanket)",
    "Also used figuratively to mean \"to hide/conceal\" — *tapar un error* (to cover up a mistake)",
    "Related: *tapa* (lid, cover; also the Spanish appetizer!), *tapón* (stopper, plug, traffic jam), *destapar* (to uncover, opposite)"
  ],
